# Optional deployment override. The local build reads COMMUNITY_GITHUB_TOKEN
# from the project root .env; a deployment may provide its own site .env, and
# that value wins over the project root. Never commit the real .env.
#
# GitHub fine-grained token with repository permission Discussions: Read-only.
# Resource owner: FormaMindPro; repository: FormaMindPro/vibeforma.
COMMUNITY_GITHUB_TOKEN=
